<title>SWITZERLAND: Schindler H1 results due after bourse.</title>
<headline>Schindler H1 results due after bourse.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss-based elevator and escalator maker Schindler Holding AG said it would publish half-year results after the Swiss bourse closes at 1430 GMT on Monday.</p>
<p>A Schindler statement said it would release an interim shareholder letter on performance at the Schindler group, including computer subsidiary ALSO.</p>
<p>Schindler last year posted first half turnover of 2,182 million Swiss francs, up 1.1 percent from 2,159 million for the first six months of 1994.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
